  OPEN mode (body). This command is case-sensitive.

   Command      Description
 -------------  -------------------------------------------------------------
  <digit>       response number
   Space/>/Enter next message
   BS/<         previous message
   =            to the basenote
   *            last response
   j/+          next note
   -            previous note
   l,TAB        next unread response
   L            next unread note
   w            post a response
   i            to INDEX
   d            delete your own post (basenote / current response)
   ! % G        Important / Close / AWO
   q,ESC        quit
 -------------  -------------------------------------------------------------
             Search / sign / mail here are not implemented.
             For external files, put a URL in the body (a note is shown).
